St. Columba Parish Annual Report, 2025
Published February 2026

Our parish family: 1,240 registered families.
Baptisms: 41. First Communions: 38. Confirmations: 35. Weddings: 9. Funerals: 52.

Outreach
The food pantry served neighbors every week of the year.
Our Christmas giving tree provided gifts for 160 children.
